WEBVTT

00:08:30.881 --> 00:08:35.511
We all have a choice, all of us,
to stand as allies,

00:08:36.262 --> 00:08:39.598
to protect the protectors of our future,
to restore balance,

00:08:40.558 --> 00:08:42.643
to survive the climate crisis.

00:08:43.435 --> 00:08:47.565
Let us work with the people who know how.

00:08:48.399 --> 00:08:49.692
Thank you.

00:08:49.692 --> 00:08:54.071
(Applause)